title="Star Wars: Thrawn Trilogy"
type="campaign"
icon="data/add-ons/Star_Wars_Thrawn_Trilogy/images/units/sw-hero-xwing-luke/standing.png"
author="weberwe3"
version="0.4.0"
description="An original, non-commercial fan total conversion set five years after Return of the Jedi. Three campaigns (30 missions): Heir to the Empire, Dark Force Rising, and The Last Command. Ground battles, escapes and space combat with lore terrain, faction-coloured blaster fire, named Legends characters, an in-game Field Manual, and original story, painted art, synthesized sound effects and music. No copyrighted prose, film, game assets, sound, or music are used."
